  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> be a vector such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to _______.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
